#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Hash-bound, fail-closed runner for the Phase 5D object-only source run.

The default and fixture modes never invoke Git.  The --actual mode is present
only so a separately reviewed and current Jenn decision can name immutable
runner bytes; this turn never invokes that mode.
"""

